{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 24, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "萬物由之以通.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 37, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "言道旣可以通中國, 而適夷狄, 學亦可以統正典, 而兼諸子也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0020_0020", "id": null, "offset": 17, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "礙, 限.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 12, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "什一稅民, 天下之中賦正法也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 22, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "『公羊傳』曰：多乎十一, 大桀·小桀, 寡乎十一, 大貉·小貉.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 35, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "昔之隱者, 文王拘於羑里而重易六爻, 箕子隱於殷朝而爲周陳洪範, 接輿之在楚而歌鳳兮.", "type": "원주"}
